    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d583">

                <pb facs="0623" n="519" sameAs="frus:frus1932v05/pg519"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">818.00/1335: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Costa Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Eberhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">San José</hi>
                        </placeName> [<date calendar="gregorian" when="1932-02-18T16:00:00-06:00"
                            >February 18, 1932—4 p.m.</date>]<lb/>[Received 6 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Conference between Government and Castristas now under way at Legation, firing
                    stopped at 1 p.m., and many Castrista troops have handed in arms. Insurrection
                    believed over. Further details later.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eberhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
